title: "Analysis Code for Do Standardized Residential Energy Models Represent the Variables That Matter? Evidence from Explainable Machine Learning"

abstract: >
  Analysis code supporting the standards-linked explainable machine learning
  analysis of representation adequacy in standardized residential energy models
  using RECS and EULP/ResStock datasets.

